# The API servers distribute.sh puts a database on. Copy to servers.conf beside this file and fill in
# the real hosts; servers.conf is not in this repository.
#
# The same servers as the inventory in unipept-api's .deploy, laid out the same way as far as this
# needs, but a copy of its own: each repository is deployed from its own checkout.
#
# checkout is where unipept-database is cloned on that server, owned by DEPLOY_USER, who
# distribute.sh logs in as; ~ is that user's home. Everything else a server decides, where its
# databases are and how it reaches the host it clones from, is in that checkout's
# .deploy/deploy.conf.
#
# Servers are handled in the order listed.
#
# name   host              checkout
patty    patty.ugent.be    ~/unipept-database
selma    selma.ugent.be    ~/unipept-database
rick     rick.ugent.be     ~/unipept-database
